1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 37]</font>

15
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:54,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

16
00:02:10,040 --> 00:02:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a little blood.</font>

17
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to endure the pain twice.</font>

18
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't have to hide this from me.</font>

19
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you know now, don't you?</font>

20
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

21
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haven't you noticed something's wrong?</font>

22
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is truly controlling</font>

23
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your thoughts and emotions?</font>

24
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut your mouth!</font>

25
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why should I?</font>

26
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am the wife you married twice.</font>

27
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you.</font>

28
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are Prince Duan of Beiyuan,</font>

29
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">invincible and unstoppable in battle.</font>

30
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't fall
to the Heart-Devouring Poison.</font>

31
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut your mouth!</font>

32
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would rather</font>

33
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">die</font>

34
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with you</font>

35
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">than watch</font>

36
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you</font>

37
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">live</font>

38
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like</font>

39
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a puppet.</font>

40
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

41
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wrong.</font>

42
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please forgive me.</font>

43
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop hitting me.</font>

44
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really hurts!</font>

45
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please stop hitting me.</font>

46
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really hurts!</font>

47
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, you are a wicked man.</font>

48
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you wanted me to play along,
just say so.</font>

49
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you cold-shoulder me before?</font>

50
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You made me sad for days over nothing.</font>

51
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Given your nature,</font>

52
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you couldn't fool
even a toddler in Xizhao.</font>

53
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So why are you telling me now?</font>

54
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you were dancing with Miss Lin,</font>

55
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you looked like you wanted to kill her.</font>

56
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one would believe
I am smitten with you.</font>

57
00:04:17,280 --> 00:04:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say that again.</font>

58
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You and Miss Lin...</font>

59
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not that part.</font>

60
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am smitten with you.</font>

61
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

62
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, I was wrong.</font>

63
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wrong.</font>

64
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take the approved memorials
to the Palace</font>

65
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the Great Emperor's review.</font>

66
00:04:50,640 --> 00:04:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

67
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:54,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

68
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you tell me to climb a mountain,</font>

69
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:59,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll never dare climb a tree.</font>

70
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you say fish,
I'll never dare catch shrimp.</font>

71
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please don't hit me anymore.</font>

72
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This foreign consort is pitiful,</font>

73
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so out of favor with the Crown Prince.</font>

74
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I spoke out of turn.</font>

75
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In truth, the Crown Prince dotes on her.</font>

76
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.
She's always needed a firm hand.</font>

77
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May the Crown Prince look after himself.</font>

78
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:22,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I mean... Thanks for his guidance.</font>

79
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:23,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He needs to keep disciplining her,</font>

80
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so she might finally learn some sense.</font>

81
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After tonight,</font>

82
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Bloodlure Poison will be cured.</font>

83
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you going back
to the Chengtian Sect?</font>

84
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:45,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must go back</font>

85
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to be the sacred maid's betrothed?</font>

86
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm returning this to you.</font>

87
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it away.</font>

88
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, love and promises</font>

89
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can vanish so easily.</font>

90
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:31,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rather than living in this haze,</font>

91
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I prefer a clean break.</font>

92
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:39,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're now another woman's betrothed.</font>

93
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why should I be bound by a lock of hair?</font>

94
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:04,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These five years,</font>

95
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:05,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it has always been with me.</font>

96
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought</font>

97
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd never have the chance
to give it to you.</font>

98
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now,</font>

99
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can finally return it to its owner.</font>

100
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei and I</font>

101
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">met in our youth,</font>

102
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">kindred spirits from the start.</font>

103
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:33,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've faced life and death together,</font>

104
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bound now by blood itself.</font>

105
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We met when we were young,</font>

106
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">two hearts beating as one.</font>

107
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've been through so much.</font>

108
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could never give you
the title you deserved.</font>

109
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, having faced death together,</font>

110
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our bond runs deeper than blood.</font>

111
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:56,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, from this day forward...</font>

112
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wish to stand as your husband</font>

113
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to cherish you,</font>

114
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">honor you,</font>

115
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:07,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">protect you,</font>

116
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and stay by your side forever</font>

117
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:14,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in wedded union until old age.</font>

118
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

119
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are my betrothed.</font>

120
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know your heart belongs to me.</font>

121
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao!</font>

122
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao!</font>

123
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao!</font>

124
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:50,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My head is killing me.</font>

125
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:51,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The pain is unbearable.</font>

126
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It will pass.</font>

127
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:01,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please kill me.</font>

128
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei, kill me now.</font>

129
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:07,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't bear this pain.</font>

130
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please just kill me.</font>

131
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill me.</font>

132
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now.</font>

133
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:23,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

134
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:25,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

135
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:29,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

136
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Pure as an immortal being♪</font>

137
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want a child.</font>

138
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:36,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It would be best if they looked like you</font>

139
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but had my temperament.</font>

140
00:09:41,260 --> 00:09:42,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Peach Blossom Spring (Utopia)♪</font>

141
00:09:42,910 --> 00:09:47,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

142
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:52,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

143
00:09:55,220 --> 00:09:58,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We hold each other in our hearts♪</font>

144
00:09:58,900 --> 00:10:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Unafraid of being separated
by the Magpie Bridge♪</font>

145
00:10:04,060 --> 00:10:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Above us, brilliant stars fill the sky♪</font>

146
00:10:07,050 --> 00:10:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright and lingering in your eyes♪</font>

147
00:10:12,650 --> 00:10:15,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪If you could see it too♪</font>

148
00:10:16,110 --> 00:10:20,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Tiptoe amid the vast sea of faces♪</font>

149
00:10:21,210 --> 00:10:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'll come flying to your side♪</font>

150
00:10:24,140 --> 00:10:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'll rush there without delay♪</font>

151
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:32,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To stay together in our hearts♪</font>

152
00:10:33,230 --> 00:10:37,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Unafraid of being separated
by the Magpie Bridge♪</font>

153
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:41,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Above us, brilliant stars fill the sky♪</font>

154
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:46,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright and lingering in your eyes♪</font>

155
00:10:46,690 --> 00:10:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪If you could see it too♪</font>

156
00:10:50,350 --> 00:10:55,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Tiptoe amid the vast sea of faces♪</font>

157
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:58,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'll come flying to your side♪</font>

158
00:10:58,410 --> 00:11:02,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'll rush there without delay♪</font>

159
00:11:04,210 --> 00:11:10,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Crossing the sharp edges
to deliver a poem for you♪</font>

160
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:21,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

161
00:11:22,160 --> 00:11:23,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's time for you to come back.</font>

162
00:11:41,880 --> 00:11:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once the Thousand Knots is severed,</font>

163
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:46,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must drink her heart's blood.</font>

164
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:48,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only then will your poison
be fully cured.</font>

165
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, all will be for nothing.</font>

166
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you do it?</font>

167
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stabbing her</font>

168
00:11:57,560 --> 00:11:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will quell the hatred in my heart.</font>

169
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss.</font>

170
00:12:15,040 --> 00:12:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Time to get up.</font>

171
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is terrible!</font>

172
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:23,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something dreadful
has happened to Miss Qin!</font>

173
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone, come!</font>

174
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A great calamity!</font>

175
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

176
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The pain is unbearable.</font>

177
00:12:39,040 --> 00:12:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It will pass.</font>

178
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please kill me now.</font>

179
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

180
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

181
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just kill me.</font>

182
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do it.</font>

183
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:58,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is my sister's injury?</font>

184
00:12:58,480 --> 00:12:59,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

185
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">although the wound is critical,</font>

186
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she will fully recover</font>

187
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with careful treatment.</font>

188
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you going?</font>

189
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you holding that dagger?</font>

190
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to kill him.</font>

191
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:15,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai.</font>

192
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must not go.</font>

193
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai.</font>

194
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go.</font>

195
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

196
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:21,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss, please stay calm.</font>

197
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss.</font>

198
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

199
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

200
00:13:24,040 --> 00:13:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're awake.</font>

201
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:28,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun, are you alright?</font>

202
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

203
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was it truly Li Congyao who stabbed you?</font>

204
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must be done with him now.</font>

205
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've done all I could.</font>

206
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I gave it everything.</font>

207
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rather than watch him torn</font>

208
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">between the sacred maid and me,</font>

209
00:13:56,280 --> 00:13:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's better to let go.</font>

210
00:14:00,680 --> 00:14:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let him become that Ruling.</font>

211
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:12,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

212
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

213
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

214
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:17,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

215
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

216
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

217
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am Prince Duan of Beiyuan.</font>

218
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My name is Li Congyao.</font>

219
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My wife</font>

220
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is Qin Wei.</font>

221
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

222
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun is already asleep.</font>

223
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You needn't worry.</font>

224
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll take good care of her health,</font>

225
00:15:03,280 --> 00:15:04,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and within a few days,</font>

226
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she'll be back to her spirited self.</font>

227
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physical wounds heal easily,</font>

228
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but a wounded heart is hard to mend.</font>

229
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know Jun's character best.</font>

230
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though she is a woman,</font>

231
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:20,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she has a fierce and unyielding spirit.</font>

232
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:22,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These hardships will not break her.</font>

233
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:26,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

234
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it is just as the saying goes.</font>

235
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well.</font>

236
00:15:32,560 --> 00:15:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Amid hills and streams,
the road seems lost.</font>

237
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:39,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll set my cloud-white sail
across the sea.</font>

238
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've mixed up the lines.</font>

239
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

240
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you really don't need to worry.</font>

241
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just leave</font>

242
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun's wound to me.</font>

243
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I promise to get the job done.</font>

244
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You little fool.</font>

245
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

246
00:15:59,760 --> 00:16:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

247
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, terrible news!</font>

248
00:16:02,040 --> 00:16:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

249
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Overnight,
the city's red eye disease cases</font>

250
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have surged dramatically.</font>

251
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are six clinics in the city,</font>

252
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and every one</font>

253
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is overwhelmed.</font>

254
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The illness in the villages</font>

255
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was already contained.</font>

256
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did it spread into the city?</font>

257
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has the source been found?</font>

258
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:14,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not yet.</font>

259
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many are infected now?</font>

260
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there anywhere to house them?</font>

261
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The village outside the city
for the sick</font>

262
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can't possibly hold so many people.</font>

263
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're just left
to fend for themselves.</font>

264
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

265
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this disease is highly contagious.</font>

266
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we can't find a cure,</font>

267
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:29,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear our capital</font>

268
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will be lost as well.</font>

269
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Allocate a portion of silver</font>

270
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:32,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from the Prince's Residence</font>

271
00:16:32,760 --> 00:16:33,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to shelter the sick.</font>

272
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Send the guards</font>

273
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to help the officials evacuate the sick.</font>

274
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ensure they take proper precautions.</font>

275
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:39,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

276
00:16:54,640 --> 00:16:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady,</font>

277
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:56,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">once the red eye disease broke out,</font>

278
00:16:56,560 --> 00:16:57,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the court was indeed caught off guard.</font>

279
00:16:58,240 --> 00:17:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now the gates swarm
with those seeking help.</font>

280
00:17:00,640 --> 00:17:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already calmed them down.</font>

281
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord's foresight is divine.</font>

282
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:07,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this way, our sect's standing</font>

283
00:17:07,600 --> 00:17:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the people's hearts</font>

284
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will greatly rise.</font>

285
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Fourth Prince has asked
the Great Emperor</font>

286
00:17:13,600 --> 00:17:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and will pray at the Hall in two days.</font>

287
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord told us</font>

288
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to act swiftly.</font>

289
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since the Fourth Prince</font>

290
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is so eager</font>

291
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to secure the people's welfare,</font>

292
00:17:24,080 --> 00:17:26,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we shall help him fulfill this wish.</font>

293
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will prepare at once.</font>

294
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

295
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:34,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has Ruling returned?</font>

296
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:37,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Word has come
from the Prince's Residence.</font>

297
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The woman was indeed stabbed
in the chest.</font>

298
00:17:40,280 --> 00:17:41,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Lord Ruling has not come back.</font>

299
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:43,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where has he gone?</font>

300
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Unknown.</font>

301
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:45,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Useless!</font>

302
00:17:46,800 --> 00:17:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't even keep an eye on a man.</font>

303
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady,</font>

304
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we lied to Lord Ruling,</font>

305
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">saying he needs
heart's blood to cure it.</font>

306
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if he finds out we were testing him</font>

307
00:17:55,360 --> 00:17:56,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and leaves the Chengtian Sect?</font>

308
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impossible.</font>

309
00:17:57,800 --> 00:18:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nightly, I worsen
the Heart-Devouring Poison.</font>

310
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:03,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He can never escape my control.</font>

311
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:07,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

312
00:18:08,370 --> 00:18:09,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

313
00:18:10,040 --> 00:18:13,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

314
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

315
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

316
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

317
00:18:27,150 --> 00:18:31,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

318
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:37,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

319
00:18:39,610 --> 00:18:43,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

320
00:18:44,290 --> 00:18:47,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

321
00:18:48,330 --> 00:18:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

322
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:55,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

323
00:18:56,860 --> 00:19:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

324
00:19:01,460 --> 00:19:05,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
